      brief: "A federal judge ordered the $70 million receivership sale of Centre Square, Philadelphia's largest office complex, to close by October 16, overriding objections and the buyer's attempt to back out.",
      category: "lending-foreclosure",
      status: "ruling",
      date: "2026-08-17",
