      brief: "Dearborn, Michigan's Fairlane Town Center mall has been in receivership since January 2026 after Kohan Retail Investment Group defaulted on a $28 million loan from a Peachtree Group affiliate; a sale is being readied.",
      category: "lending-foreclosure",
