      brief: "The Mississippi Supreme Court affirmed that about one acre of Biloxi waterfront, the former Lady Luck Casino site, is privately owned, not State land, favoring a 1784 Spanish land grant over a 1994 tidelands map.",
      category: "zoning-land-use",
